{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-commuting-deduction-calculator UI copy.details","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-commuting-deduction-calculator.copy.details","keys":["norway-commuting-deduction-calculator.copy.details"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Le scénario ZXQPH0000QXZ applique NOK ZXQPH0001QXZ par kilomètre pour une distance aller simple admissible d'au moins ZXQPH0002QXZ km, multiplie par deux les directions et les jours de trajet que vous entrez, applique le plafond brut NOK ZXQPH0003QXZ, puis soustrait le seuil NOK ZXQPH0004QXZ.","record_id":"d70f764183851ad0ce84146db34fad1791db0f448a627987c67dadd71f8d6e63","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.7053519532501014,"source":"The 2026 scenario applies NOK 1.90 per kilometre for a qualifying one-way distance of at least 2.5 km, multiplies by two directions and the commuting days you enter, applies the NOK 120,000 gross ceiling, then subtracts the NOK 12,000 threshold. The tax effect uses a rate you enter.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"814d45086551e8c5f8f7ff1ac3158de323cd5789d4d8eac3635afe0f2d8c8be7","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Le scénario 2026 applique NOK 1.90 par kilomètre pour une distance aller simple admissible d'au moins 2.5 km, multiplie par deux les directions et les jours de trajet que vous entrez, applique le plafond brut NOK 120,000, puis soustrait le seuil NOK 12,000.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
